    {
      "id": "claim_38a5a1a6528e4baf856d4dbfe6e24a38",
      "statement": "`@zhangj1164/dsh-memo@0.1.0` 曾以 `\"@zhangj1164/dsh-telemetry\": \"workspace:^\"` 作为 peer 范围上架，npm 消费者安装时得到 `EUNSUPPORTEDPROTOCOL: Unsupported URL Type \"workspace:\"`；pnpm 对该协议只打印警告，所以工作区内安装与门禁全绿都无法暴露该缺陷。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://AGENTS.md#L91-L91",
