    {
      "id": "claim_ab0ceefaf8c344c88b2a402e7ac17069",
      "statement": "`@zhangj1164/dsh-openwiki-visualize` 的自更新把这些发布当作更新源：`readOwnVersion()` 从构建产物旁的 `package.json` 读 `version`，`checkUpdate()` GET `${registryUrl}/${encodePackageName(packageName)}` 取 `dist-tags.latest`，并令 `updateAvailable = latest !== current && meetsMinimum(latest, current)`，因此相等或更旧的 registry 版本都不算更新。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/openwiki/dsh-openwiki-visualize/src/index.ts#L424-L441",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5d7b7bbbc9737cddd5581d964855f59dac7ddbb97f185dad3a192adc6a3cb13c:"
        },
        {
