          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0751461423b7c1148bc863a3129f96763d91204349d2bcaa90aee36e5393e9bd:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e70cdaafea6046a1bfe5fee201142c9f",
      "statement": "自更新检查对 registry 不可达 fail closed：报告带 `failure.code = 'registry-unreachable'` 且 `updateAvailable` 保持 false，而不是把离线读成「已是最新」。",
      "evidence": [
